-<!DOCTYPE html>
-<title>Reference for WebVTT rendering, too many cues - cues that cannot fit should not be shown</title>
-<script src="../../../../../../../resources/ahem.js"></script>
-<style>
-html { overflow:hidden }
-body { margin:0 }
-.video {
-    display: inline-block;
-    width: 1280px;
-    height: 720px;
-    position: relative
-}
-.cue {
-    position: absolute;
-    bottom: 0;
-    left: 15%;
-    right: 0;
-    width: 70%;
-    text-align: center
